<title>USA: Queens County Q4 shr down with charge.</title>
<headline>Queens County Q4 shr down with charge.</headline>
<dateline>FLUSHING, N.Y. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net			  3,800		    5,300</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.83		    $2.58</p>
<p> Net			 20,900		   20,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 shr figures includes a non-recurring income tax charge of $1.8 million. Excluding the charge, which the company said is anticipated to be reversed in 1997, 1996 full year income would have been $22.7 million, or $3.07 per share.</p>
<p>Q4 oper shr was $0.80 versus $0.68</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $1.36 billion versus $1.24 billion at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is Queens County Bancorp Inc</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
